<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:40.170
CHAPTER 15

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:45.110
ZUNBERA SPIRITPLASTY

00:02:55.680 --> 00:02:58.190
What's with those socks all the time?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:02:59.860
They don't suit her at all.

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.690
Talk about "Boo-sano."

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:04.610
-Hey now.
-Seriously?

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:06.610
Whoa...

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:08.740
Hey, don't.

00:03:18.870 --> 00:03:20.370
Yusuke-kun!

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:23.380
Yusuke-kun, hello!

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:24.800
Nice work filming!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:25.920
Yusuke-kun!

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.630
Hello, everyone.

00:03:31.180 --> 00:03:33.090
Uh... Um...

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.310
Oh, Kirara-san.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.600
Good job today. This is from everyone.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.940
Th-Thank you.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:45.070
You know that shop you
mentioned before, Yusuke-kun?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:46.610
Let's go, let's go!

00:03:46.610 --> 00:03:48.820
I went ahead and checked it out.

00:03:51.780 --> 00:03:53.530
Kirara-chan?

00:03:55.200 --> 00:03:58.600
What's wrong?
You're just standing there...

00:03:58.600 --> 00:04:01.040
Uh... Nothing...

00:04:02.600 --> 00:04:05.050
That girl's a little gloomy.

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:08.750
Her name's Fusano,
but people are calling her Boo-sano.

00:04:28.020 --> 00:04:31.070
Kirara-chan, could you get that?

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:34.400
Yes?

00:04:36.450 --> 00:04:39.080
Uh, s-sorry...

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.810
You startled me...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.180
I need your signature.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:46.400
Eww! What is that?!

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:50.710
It's Boo-sano, the <i>yokai</i> girl! Run, run!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:54.340
Uh, thank you.

00:04:58.180 --> 00:05:02.350
Sorry, I was busy. Who was it?

00:05:04.270 --> 00:05:05.660
It's your fault!

00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:08.150
It's all your fault!

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:20.330
Little girl, what's troubling you?

00:05:23.890 --> 00:05:25.080
Who are you?

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:31.230
I'm sure I can clear
what clouds your heart...

00:05:38.140 --> 00:05:44.160
So, if I have this Spiritplasty,
I can really have this face?

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:47.230
Yes. Of course.

00:05:48.020 --> 00:05:50.480
You don't believe me?

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:51.730
Then...

00:05:59.030 --> 00:06:01.870
As you can see, with this procedure...

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:08.310
You can be reborn with a beautiful face.

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:12.310
But, I don't have any m-money...

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:14.680
I don't need such things.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:18.320
All you need to do is eat this.

00:06:25.680 --> 00:06:27.580
Here. Eat up.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:29.730
It's a human soul tempura.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:47.210
Man, humans are so impatient.

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:51.380
Don't pay back some money you've borrowed
and they chase you forever.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.510
Whew, I'm pooped...

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.090
Down we go.

00:06:56.590 --> 00:06:57.420
Huh?

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:00.780
A house? All the way out here?

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.470
Well, well...

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:37.630
Uh, your name!
Could you tell me your name?

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.840
Hey, no fair! I was going to ask--

00:07:40.840 --> 00:07:44.180
Wow, you look like a doll! I'm captivated!

00:07:44.180 --> 00:07:46.620
Where'd you get those socks?
They're so cute!

00:07:46.620 --> 00:07:49.600
Are you a transfer student?
What class are you in?

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.980
Class 1-C...

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:54.120
I'm Kirara Fusano...

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.100
Huh?! You're kidding...!

00:08:00.100 --> 00:08:01.340
Oh wow...!

00:08:16.650 --> 00:08:19.150
Are you interested in
the entertainment industry?

00:08:19.150 --> 00:08:20.130
Uh...

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:22.720
You could charm the world.

00:08:23.050 --> 00:08:24.890
I knew it at once!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.850
Me...?

00:08:28.890 --> 00:08:30.520
Good work, Yusuke-kun!

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:31.770
Thank you.

00:08:33.020 --> 00:08:34.440
You're...

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.480
Anybody know her?

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:39.530
They look really good together.

00:08:39.530 --> 00:08:41.410
It's a gorgeous pair!

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.530
Kirara-san?

00:08:44.090 --> 00:08:45.910
Kirara? That Kirara?!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:47.220
No way.

00:08:47.490 --> 00:08:49.710
How could you tell?!

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.750
I can tell because
I've always looked at you...

00:08:52.750 --> 00:08:53.460
Huh?

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:54.290
Uh...

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.090
You got plastic surgery?

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:59.500
But, your face doesn't matter.

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.800
My face doesn't matter...?

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.550
I...

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.810
I don't believe that!

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.290
Oh! Kirara-san!

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:19.040
How dare she...
Yusuke-kun belongs to everyone.

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.440
It's like she's
a completely different person!

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.710
Ahem. Something on your mind?

00:09:31.710 --> 00:09:33.120
Who the heck are you?!

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:36.130
No, no. You don't have to say anything.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:41.010
What's on the mind of a girl your age
is universally the same.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.240
Actually, I happen to know someone
who can solve such prob--

00:09:45.240 --> 00:09:47.050
Excuse me.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:52.600
You know, that other girl
got her current face there, too.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.100
-Huh?
-Would you at least like to listen?

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.610
Right now my referral fee is...

00:09:57.610 --> 00:10:00.110
Hmm. Just this much.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.110
Catchick, what are you doing?

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:09.740
N-Nothing! I just had something in my eye.

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:12.200
Are you okay? Want me to look?

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:13.870
Yo, Kitaro!

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:15.460
Rat Man.

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:20.090
This is perfect. It's been a while
since we had ramen. Wanna go?

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:22.460
Sure I'd like to, but...

00:10:22.790 --> 00:10:25.510
Don't worry about it. It's my treat.

00:10:25.510 --> 00:10:28.470
If you want,
you can get extra roasted pork.

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:29.560
You?

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:33.230
You're up to some dirty
get-rich scheme again aren't you?

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:36.850
Th-That's a little harsh.
I just helped troubled humans--

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:39.690
What did you do? Spit it out!

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:43.250
Bye, Kitaro! Maybe next time!

00:10:46.570 --> 00:10:48.620
Whew, I'm stuffed.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:52.140
Miso ramen with
extra roasted pork is the best.

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:54.710
You're in a good mood, Rat Man.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:56.370
Hey, Zunbera.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:58.630
It's all thanks to you.

00:10:58.630 --> 00:11:02.860
Who knew just bringing humans here
would make for such a profit?

00:11:05.070 --> 00:11:09.260
But are you sure you don't mind
your share being zero?

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:12.590
I mean, I wouldn't wanna
force you to take...

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:16.990
Sorry, but I'm not interested in money.

00:11:20.480 --> 00:11:24.250
Uh, your name!
Could you tell me your name?

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:28.200
Wow, you look like a doll! I'm captivated!

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.320
You could charm the world.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:32.080
I knew it at once!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.260
But, your face doesn't matter.

00:11:53.470 --> 00:11:55.070
Sorry about that.

00:11:55.070 --> 00:11:56.810
Are you all right?

00:11:57.140 --> 00:11:59.980
Mana-chan...

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.130
MANGA "THE GUY WHO HARVESTS HUMAN SOULS"

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:14.640
<i>YOKAI</i> ZUNBERABO

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.570
<i>-"I sense </i>yokai<i> activity."</i>
<i>-"Scratch, scratch."</i>

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:14.570
<i>"What is this guy...?"</i>

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:18.160
Two, four, six, eight, ten...

00:12:18.160 --> 00:12:19.710
I guess that's about it.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:21.920
If we opened a Spiritplasty clinic,

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:25.500
people across the country would come
and we could get more money...

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.290
Rat Man!

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:32.850
What is this all of a sudden?!

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:34.640
Mana told us everything.

00:12:34.640 --> 00:12:39.310
We hear you teamed up with some <i>yokai</i>
named Zunbera and are tricking humans.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:41.060
We're not tricking them!

00:12:41.060 --> 00:12:44.480
I just introduce humans to Zunbera,

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:48.320
and as thanks
I get a little token of gratitude.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:50.670
That's tricking them!

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:56.370
The people who went to Zunbera are
losing their faces and are in trouble!

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.040
Who cares?

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:02.500
These are people who'd easily throw away
their own faces. So what if they lose--

00:13:02.500 --> 00:13:04.130
Rat Man.

00:13:04.130 --> 00:13:08.380
Take the people who've lost their faces
and go to Zunbera.

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:10.070
We're getting their faces back.

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:11.880
I-I get it.

00:13:11.880 --> 00:13:15.090
I get it,
so don't glare at me like that....

00:13:18.260 --> 00:13:20.780
What's the meaning of this?!
My face is gone!

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.040
Didn't you know?

00:13:24.040 --> 00:13:28.670
You peel off one face
and place a dead person's face over it...

00:13:29.480 --> 00:13:32.050
That is Spiritplasty.

00:13:32.050 --> 00:13:34.030
A dead person's face...?

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:35.120
Yes.

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:37.510
What you were wearing

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:41.510
were faces peeled off from the dead.

00:13:42.770 --> 00:13:44.730
No... Are you kidding me?!

00:13:56.150 --> 00:13:58.490
G-Gross...

00:14:02.030 --> 00:14:03.850
K-Kirara-chan...

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.150
I-It's okay!

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:10.190
The other day I stepped on dog poo
with my brand new shoes!

00:14:10.190 --> 00:14:12.800
Compared to that,
a dead person's face is...

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.700
This is all your fault!

00:14:16.700 --> 00:14:19.870
You said I could easily become pretty!

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:21.120
M-Me?!

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:25.330
Zunbera, is there a way
to restore their faces?

00:14:25.330 --> 00:14:26.230
Yes.

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:33.340
Just put on your original faces here
and everything goes back to normal.

00:14:33.340 --> 00:14:34.930
My face!

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.650
If you desire, I will return your faces.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:41.820
You're strangely compliant.

00:14:42.140 --> 00:14:44.470
What are you after?

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:48.230
I'm not after anything.

00:14:48.810 --> 00:14:54.610
I simply find women driven mad by beauty
wonderfully precious.

00:14:55.280 --> 00:14:58.030
Their bottomless avarice.

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:00.840
Zunbera was once

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:06.080
a woman so driven for beauty that she
drank mercury and died, becoming a <i>yokai</i>.

00:15:06.080 --> 00:15:08.380
Or so I've heard.

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:12.590
So she finds humans like herself
to be precious.

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.800
Of course I'll return to normal!

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:17.650
Who'd want a dead person's face?!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.180
Are you really sure?

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:26.410
Didn't you want to be beautiful
and become someone special?

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:29.270
Think it over.

00:15:29.270 --> 00:15:33.580
A dead person's face can be re-applied
as much as you like.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:36.090
I...

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:39.030
Do you want to become a <i>yokai</i>?

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:42.450
Rather than indifferently
wearing a dead face,

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:47.100
smiling proudly with your own seems
a much happier way to live, doesn't it?

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:51.100
You're... right.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:54.330
Besides, my old face isn't that bad.

00:16:07.180 --> 00:16:08.940
Now it's your turn.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.310
I...

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:12.500
Here. Hurry.

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.610
I... I'm...

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:19.050
You don't intend to
stay that way yourself, do you?

00:16:19.650 --> 00:16:21.990
You'll become a <i>yokai</i>.

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:36.840
Huh?!

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:39.730
Kirara-chan!

00:16:45.050 --> 00:16:46.260
I found you!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.180
Yusuke-kun?!

00:16:53.000 --> 00:16:54.820
I've been looking for you.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:58.750
I thought maybe I said something
insensitive to you, Kirara-san.

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:04.450
Tell me, Yusuke-kun, have you
liked me ever since I had my old face?

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:05.410
Yeah.

00:17:05.410 --> 00:17:08.290
The other girls only see me for my face.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.490
But you're different, Kirara-san.

00:17:10.930 --> 00:17:16.040
The beauty of your heart is conveyed
through your letters, Kirara-san.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:21.340
When I mess up on stage,
you give me the most comforting words.

00:17:22.760 --> 00:17:27.430
When I get a new gig, you celebrate
from the bottom of your heart.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:31.070
We haven't directly shared many words,

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:35.210
but your letters were
my spiritual support, Kirara-san.

00:17:35.210 --> 00:17:37.670
I see... Then...

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:41.550
Even like this?

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.570
There she is!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:55.060
Kirara-chan,
are you really okay with this?

00:17:55.060 --> 00:17:57.500
K-Kirara-san?

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.300
Your face...?

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.260
She underwent Spiritplasty.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:05.890
She removed her face and replaced it
with one of a dead person.

00:18:05.890 --> 00:18:07.720
A dead person's face...

00:18:07.720 --> 00:18:09.560
Why would you ever...?

00:18:09.560 --> 00:18:12.810
You wouldn't understand, Yusuke-kun...

00:18:13.520 --> 00:18:18.690
Without your real face, there's
no telling what might happen to you.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:23.340
For you own sake, you should probably
return to your own face.

00:18:24.530 --> 00:18:25.700
Kirara-san.

00:18:25.700 --> 00:18:29.180
Like I said before,
I don't care how you look. I--

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:38.020
Get over yourself!

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:40.960
I didn't change my face for you!

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.460
I don't even like you!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:45.300
I just like myself next to you!

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.570
You're just a prop!

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:51.680
When I was cute, it was like the world
turned for the first time.

00:18:51.680 --> 00:18:53.870
Until then, I was dead!

00:18:54.180 --> 00:18:57.020
I'm sick of being dead while alive!

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:06.130
It must have been hard, Kirara-san.

00:19:06.530 --> 00:19:10.280
I'd like to heal your heart if I could.

00:19:12.820 --> 00:19:15.580
I want to accept all of you, Kirara-san.

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:18.810
Why do you care so much?

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:22.000
You've supported me until now.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.230
From now on, I want to support you.

00:19:33.600 --> 00:19:34.970
It's okay.

00:20:05.150 --> 00:20:07.920
Why didn't I realize it?

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.130
I'm so lucky.

00:20:19.700 --> 00:20:22.480
And that settles that.

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:24.900
Say, what happened to Rat Man?

00:20:24.900 --> 00:20:28.110
He's gone. He must have run off somewhere.

00:20:28.110 --> 00:20:32.720
When I find him, I've gotta make it so
he can't cause any more trouble.

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.540
Rat, my feet are tired. Bring me a chair.

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:36.830
Yes! Coming!

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.750
Rat, buy me some coffee.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.730
Yes, yes! Right away!

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:44.840
-Where's my bread?
-Yes, in a moment! Here you go!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.010
What is he doing?

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:51.840
As punishment for tricking their leader,
apparently he's their slave.

00:20:51.840 --> 00:20:55.890
Hmm. I guess there's no need for me
to scratch him up.

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:56.990
I guess not.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:59.310
So what happened to Zunbera?

00:20:59.310 --> 00:21:04.000
Oh, I told her to
stop taking people's faces, but...

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:07.900
I won't do anything.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:11.660
Not unless women need me...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.030
She's a foxy one.

00:21:15.530 --> 00:21:17.010
Yusuke-kun!

00:21:17.450 --> 00:21:19.120
-Ow, ow, ow...
-Good job today!

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:20.330
Thank you.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:22.670
Let's walk to the station together!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:23.670
Sure.

00:21:23.670 --> 00:21:27.800
You were on late night TV yesterday,
weren't you, Yusuke-kun?

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.150
You were so cool!

00:21:30.150 --> 00:21:33.840
<i>This season's big movie
features numerous big Hollywood stars.</i>

00:21:33.840 --> 00:21:37.160
<i>And making her striking debut...</i>

00:21:37.510 --> 00:21:38.740
Oh!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:41.120
<i>It's Kirara Fusano-san!</i>

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:44.690
ON THE RED CARPET!
THE RED RIVER AWARD WINNER KIRARA FUSANO!

00:21:41.990 --> 00:21:44.690
<i>Kirara-san, please give us a comment!</i>

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:49.290
<i>People of Japan, please come and see me!</i>

00:21:50.270 --> 00:21:51.800
Hey, isn't that...?

00:21:53.630 --> 00:21:54.990
Kirara-san...

